	<iconUrl>https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Tynab/YANF/main/pic/0.png</iconUrl>
    <description>Yami An Nephilim Framework</description>
    <releaseNotes>Bug-fix release (no API change):
	- Package now contains lib/net481/YANF.dll only (1.0.2 shipped without the assembly)
	- Thread-safe Load/Wait/Update screen services
	- Fixed crashes with small sizes, large borders and negative YANNb ranges
	- Fixed repaint loops and GDI leaks in the custom controls
	- YANTxt placeholder no longer replaces the text</releaseNotes>
